{"speciesId":257,"names":{"fr":"Braségali","es":"Blaziken","en":"Blaziken","ja":"バシャーモ"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"ruby","text":"In battle, BLAZIKEN blows out intense flames from its wrists and attacks foes courageously. The stronger the foe, the more intensely this POKéMON’s wrists burn."},{"language":"en","version":"sapphire","text":"BLAZIKEN has incredibly strong legs - it can easily clear a 30-story building in one leap. This POKéMON’s blazing punches leave its foes scorched and blackened."},{"language":"en","version":"emerald","text":"It learns martial arts that use punches and kicks. Every several years, its old feathers burn off, and new, supple feathers grow back in their place."},{"language":"en","version":"firered","text":"When facing a tough foe, it looses flames from its wrists. Its powerful legs let it jump clear over buildings."},{"language":"en","version":"leafgreen","text":"When facing a tough foe, it looses flames from its wrists. Its powerful legs let it jump clear over buildings."},{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"Flames spout from its wrists, enveloping its knuckles. Its punches scorch its foes."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"Flames spout from its wrists, enveloping its knuckles. Its punches scorch its foes."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"Flames spout from its wrists, enveloping its knuckles. Its punches scorch its foes."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"It can clear a 30-story building in a leap. Its fiery punches scorch its foes."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"It can clear a 30-story building in a leap. Its fiery punches scorch its foes."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Des flammes fusent de ses poignets et ses coups brûlent l’ennemi."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"Flames spout from its wrists, enveloping its knuckles. Its punches scorch its foes."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Des flammes fusent de ses poignets et ses coups brûlent l’ennemi."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"Flames spout from its wrists, enveloping its knuckles. Its punches scorch its foes."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"Flames spout from its wrists, enveloping its knuckles. Its punches scorch its foes."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"Flames spout from its wrists, enveloping its knuckles. Its punches scorch its foes."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Il peut bondir par-dessus un bâtiment de 30 étages. Ses poings enflammés brûlent ses adversaires."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Puede saltar edificios de 30 plantas. Con sus golpes de fuego quema a sus rivales."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"It can clear a 30-story building in a leap. Its fiery punches scorch its foes."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"３０階建ての ビルを ジャンプで 跳び越す 跳躍力。炎の パンチが 相手を 焼きつくす。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Quand il est face à un ennemi, il laisse s’échapper des gerbes de flammes par ses poignets. Ses jambes lui permettent de sauter par-dessus les immeubles."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Ante un rival difícil, expulsa llamas por las muñecas. Tiene mucha fuerza en las patas; hasta puede saltar edificios."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"When facing a tough foe, it looses flames from its wrists. Its powerful legs let it jump clear over buildings."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"強敵に 出会うと 手首から 炎を 噴き出す。ジャンプで ビルで 跳び越す 脚力。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Au combat, Braségali envoie des flammes ardentes de ses poignets. Il fait preuve d’un courage exceptionnel. Plus l’ennemi est puissant, plus les poignets de ce Pokémon sont ardents."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"En combate, Blaziken expulsa vivas llamas por las muñecas y ataca al enemigo con fiereza. Cuanto más fuerte sea el enemigo, más intensas serán las llamas."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"In battle, Blaziken blows out intense flames from its wrists and attacks foes courageously. The stronger the foe, the more intensely this Pokémon’s wrists burn."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"戦いに なると 手首から 灼熱の 炎を 噴き上げ 勇敢に 挑みかかる、 相手が 手強いほど 激しく 燃えあがる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Braségali a des jambes incroyablement puissantes. Il peut sauter par-dessus un immeuble de trente étages. Les coups de poing enflammés de ce Pokémon peuvent carboniser ses ennemis."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Blaziken tiene unas piernas tan fuertes que puede saltar por encima de un edificio de 30 pisos con facilidad. Además, da unos puñetazos fulminantes que dejan al oponente chamuscado y lleno de tizne."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Blaziken has incredibly strong legs—it can easily clear a 30-story building in one leap. This Pokémon’s blazing punches leave its foes scorched and blackened."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"強靭な 足腰を 持ち ３０階 建ての ビルも 楽々 飛び越す ことが できる。 炎の パンチで 相手を 黒焦げに する。"}],"varieties":[{"id":257,"moves":[{"name":"mega-punch","learns":[[6,"tutor",0],[7,"tutor",0],[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"fire-punch","learns":[[5,"level-up",1],[6,"level-up",1],[6,"tutor",0],[7,"level-up",1],[8,"level-up",1],[9,"level-up",1],[9,"tutor",0],[10,"level-up",1],[10,"tutor",0],[11,"level-up",1],[12,"level-up",1],[13,"level-up",1],[14,"level-up",1],[14,"tutor",0],[15,"level-up",1],[16,"level-up",1],[16,"tutor",0],[17,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",1],[18,"tutor",0],[20,"level-up",1],[20,"machine",0],[23,"level-up",1],[25,"egg",0],[25,"machine",0],[32,"train",0]]},{"name":"thunder-punch","learns":[[6,"tutor",0],[9,"tutor",0],[10,"tutor",0],[14,"tutor",0],[16,"tutor",0],[18,"tutor",0],[20,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0],[32,"train",0]]},{"name":"scratch","learns":[[5,"level-up",1],[6,"level-up",1],[7,"level-up",1],[8,"level-up",1],[9,"level-up",1],[10,"level-up",1],[11,"level-up",1],[12,"level-up",1],[13,"level-up",1],[14,"level-u